          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "A student needs at least 190 signatures from classmates to run for class president. The student\ncollects 30 signatures on Monday and collects enough additional signatures on Tuesday to run for\nclass president. Which inequality represents the number of additional signatures, $s$, that the\nstudent collects on Tuesday?"
